Z||000004||b_b_a_d||03-17-2000||05:13 AM||||ahem...  cough cough...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><P>My Camaro exhibited similar problems with backfiring through the intake due to an exhaust leak from a bad O ring where the exhaust pipes off the manifold met.  But it was pretty obvious there was an exhaust leak with the hood up. <P>It was just a 100 to 1 shot...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>||||reg||1
